sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller as 二手卖家
    actor BidderA as 买家 A
    actor BidderB as 买家 B
    participant UI as Vue/Nginx
    participant API as SecondhandTradeController
    participant Service as SecondhandTradeServiceImpl
    participant Funds as EscrowSettlementService
    participant DB as MySQL

    Seller->>UI: 填写起拍价、加价幅度和时长
    UI->>API: POST /auction
    API->>Service: createAuction
    Service->>DB: 校验商品所有权、状态和重复进行中拍卖
    Service->>DB: INSERT product_auction(ONGOING)
    BidderA->>UI: 首次出价
    UI->>API: POST /auction/{id}/bid
    Service->>Funds: 冻结首次出价
    Service->>DB: 乐观锁更新最高价并写竞价日志
    BidderB->>UI: 更高出价
    UI->>API: POST /auction/{id}/bid
    Service->>Funds: 冻结新出价并退回买家 A
    Service->>DB: 乐观锁更新最高价并写竞价日志
    Seller->>UI: 查看当前价、最高出价人和出价次数
    Seller->>API: POST /auction/{id}/close
    API->>Service: closeAuctionEarly
    Service->>DB: 抢占 ONGOING -> SETTLING
    alt 没有有效出价
        Service->>DB: 拍卖 -> FLOW，商品 -> 下架
    else 存在最高出价
        Service->>DB: 写已付款待发货订单和明细
        Service->>DB: 商品 -> 已售，拍卖 -> FINISHED
    end
    BidderB->>UI: 查看竞拍结果和待发货订单
